section: ghc-internal
synopsis: Fix excessive GC, memory use and timer latency when many threads
  register timeouts at once with ``threadDelay``, ``registerDelay`` or
  ``System.Timeout.timeout``.
issues: #9809
mrs: !16863
description: {
    Threads registering timeouts now publish only fully evaluated updates to
    the timer manager's timeout queue, using a compare-and-swap loop, instead
    of building chains of unevaluated updates that other threads then had to
    evaluate or block on.
}
